	// O=(0,0), P=(x1, y1), Q=(x2, y2) and 0 <= x1,y1,x2,y2 <= 50.
	// Outer loops iterate through P=(x1, y1) and x2 using scalar registers.
	// The innermost loop over y2 is vectorized using SVE.

